  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_00",
      "hash64": "7EE9C25EC927EBA9",
      "text": "大家，抱歉……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "F1B3A41EED808681",
      "text": "大約１年多前……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_01",
      "hash64": "7EE9C15EC927E9F6",
      "text": "抱歉……\\n因為布料的採購延遲了……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_honooboss_01",
      "hash64": "3FEE639A2D55390C",
      "text": "太酷了……\\n特別是這個靴子太酷了……[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_02",
      "hash64": "7EE9C05EC927E843",
      "text": "靴子的靈感是來自蓄能焰襲……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_kakutouboss_01",
      "hash64": "4918872BA1141559",
      "text": "我的制服也和我想像的一樣，\\n真是太謝謝你了。[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_03",
      "hash64": "7EE9BF5EC927E690",
      "text": "如果能實現地獄偶像枇琶閣下的構想，\\n在下三生有幸。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_01",
      "hash64": "36523EDB08117B0C",
      "text": "這麼一來所有人的制服都改造完畢。\\n真是太thank you了，秋明。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_02",
      "hash64": "365241DB08118025",
      "text": "妳們兩個看起來那麼酷的話，\\n一定可以帶來很強的壓迫感。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_fairyboss_01",
      "hash64": "0E1DF61F5DCB6AEA",
      "text": "不過，秋明你的手還真是巧～[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_fairyboss_02",
      "hash64": "0E1DF51F5DCB6937",
      "text": "那些只因為你是阿宅就霸凌你的傢伙們，\\n真的很傻啊～[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_04",
      "hash64": "7EE9C65EC927F275",
      "text": "阿宅走的路是修羅相伴的荊棘之路。\\n在下不奢望凡人能夠理解。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_honooboss_02",
      "hash64": "3FEE669A2D553E25",
      "text": "喲喲！怎麼了，秋明！\\n你說的話很有氣勢嘛！[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_kakutouboss_02",
      "hash64": "4918842BA1141040",
      "text": "是呀，秋明。\\n我覺得你很酷喔～[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_03",
      "hash64": "365240DB08117E72",
      "text": "那麼，作為天星大作戰的準備，\\n接下來我們來做戰鬥的訓練吧。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_04",
      "hash64": "36523BDB081175F3",
      "text": "身為老大的我們可不能\\n比其他成員來得弱。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_05",
      "hash64": "7EE9C55EC927F0C2",
      "text": "明白……\\n在下會全心全力不斷修練……！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_06",
      "hash64": "7EE9C45EC927EF0F",
      "text": "在下雖全心全力，\\n但最高原則是不能違抗的……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_07",
      "hash64": "7EE9C35EC927ED5C",
      "text": "這個最高原則就是隊規……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_08",
      "hash64": "7EE9CA5EC927F941",
      "text": "因為是隊規，這個you請拿去吧……\\n是you的話，在下相信可以託付的。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_waza_01",
      "hash64": "D28430A2470ED9B9",
      "text": "還有這個機關也請收下。\\n裡面記錄了發射垃圾的招式。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_09",
      "hash64": "7EE9C95EC927F78E",
      "text": "You的名字是……\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]啊。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_10",
      "hash64": "7EE63C5EC924D220",
      "text": "在下是輸得如此徹底，\\n甚至沒有一絲怨恨和痛苦……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_01",
      "hash64": "E6637BEF86A2512B",
      "text": "秋明閣下！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_11",
      "hash64": "7EE63D5EC924D3D3",
      "text": "同、同胞？[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_01",
      "hash64": "BD2F1C2F0598E27F",
      "text": "他似乎無論如何都要見到你，\\n想直接和你說話。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_02",
      "hash64": "E6637CEF86A252DE",
      "text": "秋明閣下聽我說！\\n只要一下下就好了！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_12",
      "hash64": "7EE63E5EC924D586",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "BD2F1D2F0598E432",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_13",
      "hash64": "7EE63F5EC924D739",
      "text": "……閣下為什麼會來這裡？[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_03",
      "hash64": "E6637DEF86A25491",
      "text": "因為我想幫幫我的同胞！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_04",
      "hash64": "E6637EEF86A25644",
      "text": "像現在這樣一直不去上學的話，\\n秋明閣下會受到退學處分不是嗎……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_14",
      "hash64": "7EE6405EC924D8EC",
      "text": "…………[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_05",
      "hash64": "E6637FEF86A257F7",
      "text": "以前總是被霸凌的我們，\\n現在能去上學……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_06",
      "hash64": "E66380EF86A259AA",
      "text": "都要歸功於天星隊為了大家\\n而努力執行的那個大作戰！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_07",
      "hash64": "E66381EF86A25B5D",
      "text": "你們這些人要是退學，\\n我絕對不能接受！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_15",
      "hash64": "7EE6415EC924DA9F",
      "text": "……抱歉。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_08",
      "hash64": "E66372EF86A241E0",
      "text": "現在還是聯絡不上\\n那個叫真老大的人嗎……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_16",
      "hash64": "7EE6425EC924DC52",
      "text": "嗯，自從那天以來……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_17",
      "hash64": "7EE6435EC924DE05",
      "text": "沒有真老大，就沒有天星隊……\\n沒有天星隊的話，\\r\\n就沒有青春洋溢的學院生活！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_18",
      "hash64": "7EE6445EC924DFB8",
      "text": "在真老大回歸之前，\\n在下等人只能繼續守護基地，別無他選！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_09",
      "hash64": "E66373EF86A24393",
      "text": "你們如此信賴的真老大，\\n究竟是何方神聖？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_19",
      "hash64": "7EE6455EC924E16B",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_10",
      "hash64": "E66700EF86A56901",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_20",
      "hash64": "7EF04E5EC92D453B",
      "text": "在下等人從未實際見過真老大。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_11",
      "hash64": "E666FFEF86A5674E",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_21",
      "hash64": "7EF04D5EC92D4388",
      "text": "就本人的說法，真老大一直宅在家裡……\\n聽說與在下等人一樣，起因都是霸凌……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_12",
      "hash64": "E666FEEF86A5659B",
      "text": "好可憐……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_22",
      "hash64": "7EF0505EC92D48A1",
      "text": "雖然在下等人不知道真老大的真名和樣貌，\\n但那不會改變真老大是夥伴的事實。\\c\\n在下等人要做的就只有\\n在基地等待真老大come back！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_13",
      "hash64": "E666FDEF86A563E8",
      "text": "所以秋明閣下你才不去上學啊……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_14",
      "hash64": "E66704EF86A56FCD",
      "text": "……但是不要忘記！\\n秋明閣下你除了天星隊以外，\\r\\n還有我這個同胞在啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_23",
      "hash64": "7EF04F5EC92D46EE",
      "text": "同胞……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_15",
      "hash64": "E66703EF86A56E1A",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_16",
      "hash64": "E66702EF86A56C67",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_24",
      "hash64": "7EF0525EC92D4C07",
      "text": "……在下感激不盡。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "BD2F1E2F0598E5E5",
      "text": "霸凌……不上學……\\n我又離真相更近一步了。\\r\\n不，比起這件事……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "BD2F172F0598DA00",
      "text": "學生們面對的問題……\\n行動的理由……\\r\\n以及重要的牽絆……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "BD2F182F0598DBB3",
      "text": "我竟然絲毫沒有察覺到這些事情，\\n實在太羞愧了。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_17",
      "hash64": "E66701EF86A56AB4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_25",
      "hash64": "7EF0515EC92D4A54",
      "text": "呼……在下一直以來都\\n相信只有天星隊是至寶……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_26",
      "hash64": "7EF0545EC92D4F6D",
      "text": "……或許在下錯了呢。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
